sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant React as React (Vite :5173)
    participant Assets as AssetsService.Api (:5002)
    participant Crear as CrearActivoUseCase
    participant CatRepo as CategoriaRepository
    participant ActRepo as ActivoRepository
    participant DB as AssetsDB
    participant Calc as CalcularDepreciacionUseCase
    participant Dep as DepreciacionService

    Note over React,Assets: 1) Creación del activo
    React->>Assets: POST /api/activos (Authorization: Bearer JWT)
    Assets->>Assets: Middleware valida JWT (401 si inválido)
    Assets->>Crear: CrearActivoUseCase.EjecutarAsync(request)
    Crear->>CatRepo: ObtenerPorIdAsync(categoriaId)
    CatRepo->>DB: SELECT * FROM Categorias WHERE id = @id
    DB-->>CatRepo: Categoria
    CatRepo-->>Crear: Categoria (o null)

    alt categoria no existe
        Crear-->>Assets: null
        Assets-->>React: 400 {mensaje}
    else categoria válida
        Crear->>ActRepo: CrearAsync(activo)
        ActRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO Activos
        DB-->>ActRepo: Activo con id
        ActRepo-->>Crear: Activo
        Crear-->>Assets: ActivoResponse
        Assets-->>React: 201 {activo}
    end

    Note over React,Assets: 2) Consulta de la tabla de depreciación
    React->>Assets: GET /api/activos/{id}/depreciacion (Bearer JWT)
    Assets->>Assets: Middleware valida JWT (401 si inválido)
    Assets->>Calc: CalcularDepreciacionUseCase.EjecutarAsync(id)
    Calc->>ActRepo: ObtenerConCategoriaAsync(id)
    ActRepo->>DB: SELECT Activos JOIN Categorias WHERE id = @id
    DB-->>ActRepo: Activo + Categoria
    ActRepo-->>Calc: Activo con Categoria
    Calc->>Dep: CalcularTabla(activo, categoria)
    Dep-->>Calc: filas de depreciacion
    Calc-->>Assets: TablaDepreciacionResponse
    Assets-->>React: 200 {filas}